Package: fysetc-5inch-dsi-touch
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-headers-rpi-v8, linux-headers-rpi-2712, make, kmod
Description: Touch driver for the FYSETC Raspberry Pi 5 inch DSI Touch Screen V1.1
 Linux input driver (fysetc_touch) for the touch controller of the FYSETC
 Raspberry Pi 5 inch DSI Touch Screen MIPI LCD V1.1. The screen emulates the
 official Raspberry Pi 7" touchscreen, but its I2C touch proxy does not answer
 FT5x06 multi-byte reads correctly, which causes ghost touches with edt_ft5x06
 and wrong coordinates with rpi-ft5406.
 .
 The module is built on the device for every installed Raspberry Pi kernel
 and rebuilt automatically by a kernel hook when a new kernel is installed.
 .
 This package blacklists edt_ft5x06, so the official Raspberry Pi
 touchscreen (and other FT5x06 touchscreens) will not work while it is
 installed.
